#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:274
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_WelcomeToBattlePike"
msgid ""
"Where the luck of TRAINERS\n"
"is put to the test…\p"
"Welcome to the BATTLE PIKE…\p"
"I am your guide to the BATTLE PIKE…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:280
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_TakeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Would you like to take the Battle\n"
"Choice challenge?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:284
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_ExplainBattlePike"
msgid ""
"Here we conduct an event we call\n"
"the Battle Choice.\p"
"The Battle Choice rules are very\n"
"simple…\p"
"Choose one of three paths and make\n"
"your way to the goal room at the end\l"
"of the BATTLE PIKE. It's that simple.\p"
"However, what happens on the chosen\n"
"path depends entirely on the luck\l"
"of the challenger…\p"
"If you reach the goal, you will be\n"
"rewarded with Battle Points.\p"
"If you want to interrupt your\n"
"challenge, please have a word with\l"
"our staff in the big rooms on the way.\p"
"If you don't save before interrupting,\n"
"you will be disqualified.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:303
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_LookForwardToSeeingYou"
msgid ""
"We look forward to seeing you\n"
"on another occasion…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:307
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_WhichChallengeMode"
msgid ""
"You have the choice of two courses,\n"
"Level 50 and Open Level.\l"
"Which will you challenge?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:312
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50"
msgid ""
"I beg your pardon, but…\p"
"You do not have three eligible\n"
"POKéMON for the Battle Choice event.\p"
"You must have three different POKéMON\n"
"of Level 50 or less to enter.\p"
"They also must be holding different\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:322
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsEnd"
msgid ""
"Please come see me when\n"
"you are ready…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeLobby/scripts.inc:326
